{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312620/extras/5bc61210a115abb66bae8b63d4180f9a.avif?t=1759524907\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your night shift as a medical examiner, the FBI arrives with an unusual case: five bodies, cause of death unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hidden object game, you'll need to piece together a randomly-generated word of power by searching the five bodies. A blacklight found at the scene of the crime reveals tattoos and other strange markings hidden on each corpse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312620/extras/ea945f0a754df7fe69d2a0c841665c52.avif?t=1759524907\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a piece of paper handy to take notes on what you find, but don't take too long: the morgue's electrical system has become unpredictable, and the dead stir in the dark. Whenever the power fails, you'll need to rush to repair it, or else meet an early end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312620/extras/e7ba759e741ac22fa8cae5f59f55b90e.avif?t=1759524907\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free horror game from Hushberry Games that blends forensic investigation with supernatural terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun ;)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312620?t=1759524907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312620?t=1759524907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/